flowchart TB
  accTitle: Shared runtime state and separate authority boundaries
  accDescr: A durable state tuple contains intention, workspace, memory, skills, uncertainty, budgets, and recovery state. The language model proposes. Specialized governors authorize scoped transitions. The runtime commits a versioned change, and a separate learning operation may update a policy from an attributed outcome.
  X[Durable shared runtime state]
  LLM[Model or component proposal]
  G[Owning governor]
  T[Runtime transition and receipt]
  O[Observed outcome]
  U[Separate learning update]
  X --> LLM --> G --> T --> O --> U
  U -.-> X
  classDef store fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef proposal fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px
  classDef control fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px
  class X,T,O store
  class LLM proposal
  class G,U control
